obs The hot endurance run closed run_verdict=guard_red with seventeen reds. Two were mine and are repaired and re-proven through the runner, which cleared their evidence files. The other fifteen are the fleet's standing set: ryekey and built_tool_freshness are machine facts asking for a rebuild, stash_record was reported by my own round-open before any work, unheard_guard names twenty controls and none of them mine with law_guard_heard cascading off it, and instrument_refusal names four lines in two peers' files. Named rather than taken; no peer file touched.
status GREEN for this round's own work -- backtick_path GREEN on metal, its two reds repaired inside the lap, scan B/84, control A+/100, witness A+/100. The roster closes guard_red on fifteen reds standing outside this lane.
recommend keep-going -- the same promise stands unread in a .rish witness header, a .kyri roster comment and a .rye module head; one meter over every authored comment is the next honest lap
